    {
      "uid": "zhcn:746ce25c9a67cef8a5447463",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我比世上任何人都更近地把\n旺紫丁的努力和忍耐看在眼里。\n是世上最坚信这场胜利的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "213e58ad0331321d5760aafcc2afe25447572170141b9aa9a5aed34730e25cf6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
