    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b3237fb6a239da9affa8604",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因如此，我很不甘心。\n没能引导她走向胜利。\n还让她对我道歉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19f104479d706ed1db1a16c66c5045cb11a30bfdc0fcaa214e2c9e9a40a77281",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2d41321943c1a4a77d9f09",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不论对手有多么强大，\n旺紫丁的话，总有一天一定会赢的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b9de214fd561d348aced0bebc32053bf98dc4b83d7797cfca7ea3f0e11a6c5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92792fe9ac3b75064e868259",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她是能够耐住风雨而后绽放的赛马娘。\n身为训练员我始终坚信、支持她到底。\n我有这份觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11bb71cb1f5654eb3c68f475b36b2cfafda6767541ed9b9ec1141848d3269913",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
